Before working in this repository, read `AGENTS.md`, `agent-system/README.md`, then
read the relevant role file under `agent-system/roles/`. Follow the lifecycle in
`agent-system/workflows/lifecycle.yaml`, the ownership rules in
`agent-system/policies/ownership.md`, the security rules in
`agent-system/policies/security.md`, and the handoff format in
`agent-system/contracts/handoff.md`.

`agent-system/` is the canonical source of truth. Do not invent or override project
rules based on Cursor-specific behavior.
